 "notes": [
  {
   "book": 1,
   "row": 32,
   "sec": 8,
   "append": true,
   "md": "- **Little lasting political effect:** Alexander stayed in India only about 19 months; his campaign left almost no lasting political mark, while the earlier Persian rule left a deeper influence on script, art and administration."
  },
  {
   "book": 1,
   "row": 33,
   "sec": 2,
   "append": true,
   "md": "- **Errors in Indica:** besides the wrong \"no slavery\" claim, Indica has uncritical tales such as gold-digging ants; Strabo, following Megasthenes, wrote that Indians did not know writing."
  }
 ],
